    "note": "deliberate licensing stub (ADDENDUM C2): strings 'isLicensed', 'serial_number', 'demo'; recovered, reconstructed and validated like the DSP; a checkSerial \u2192 true edit is TRANSFORMED_BREAKING"
  }
